# The Dockerfile fetches its entire toolchain via curl/apt/opam/lake/npm and COPYs nothing
# from the build context, so the context can be trimmed to almost nothing — this keeps
# `docker build` from shipping the 1.7G repo (chiefly demo/ vendored crates) to the daemon.
.git
.venv
demo/
*-lusterna/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
*.log
